{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components are in the order Tarjan’s algorithm completes them, on a depth-first search"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with roots in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order and successors in "},{"code":"successors(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order. That is a reverse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"topological order of the condensation: every edge between components goes from a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component to an earlier one, so "},{"code":"reversed()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" lists the components with every edge going"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forward. Each component lists its vertices in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each component’s first vertex is its earliest in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"text":", so on a graph whose vertex","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"positions are insertion order (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StableDirectedGraph"},{"text":"), one sort by that vertex’s position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"puts the components in insertion order, O(C log C) for C components:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let inInsertionOrder = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","    .sorted { graph.vertexPosition(of: $0.first!) < graph.vertexPosition(of: $1.first!) }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On any graph, one pass over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, O(V):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let components = graph.stronglyConnectedComponents()","let inVertexOrder = graph.vertices.compactMap { vertex in","    let component = components[components.component(of: vertex)]","    return component.first == vertex ? component : nil","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(V + E)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Connectivity","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"stronglyConnectedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV","text":"Components"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P12ConnectivityE27stronglyConnectedComponentsAD0G0VyxGyF","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Connectivity\/StronglyConnectedComponents.swift#L148","fileName":"StronglyConnectedComponents.swift"}},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Tarjan’s algorithm."}],"references":{"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph":{"url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"extension","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectedGraph","kind":"identifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DirectedGraph","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","title":"DirectedGraph","type":"topic"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/stronglyConnectedComponents()":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/stronglyconnectedcomponents()","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/stronglyConnectedComponents()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"stronglyConnectedComponents","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Connectivity10ComponentsV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The strongly connected components: maximal sets of vertices each reaching every other, by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Tarjan’s algorithm.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"stronglyConnectedComponents()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/Components":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Components"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/Components","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A partition of a graph’s vertices into components, in a documented order: a collection of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components, each a slice of vertices in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, with an O(1) "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"component(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Components"}],"title":"Components","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/components","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"Connectivity","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://Connectivity/documentation/Connectivity/GraphProtocols":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/connectivity\/graphprotocols","identifier":"doc:\/\/Connectivity\/documentation\/Connectivity\/GraphProtocols","abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"GraphProtocols"}}}